	(text "3V3 rail from USB VBUS (5 V).\nAP2112K-3.3: 600 mA, needs 1 uF in and out (C17, C18)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 218.44 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0d2b6c30-fcb9-4afd-bd23-6b763a974485")
	)
	(text "SW2 resets the MCU (RUN low). J2 is the debug port: 1 = SWCLK, 2 = GND, 3 = SWDIO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "46f7bd09-a641-4501-a3de-a12f1298b5f5")
	)
	(text "3V3 decoupling - where each cap goes on the PCB:\nC1: at pin 44 (VREG_VIN)    C2-C7: one per IOVDD pin (1, 10, 22, 33, 42, 49)\nC8: at pin 48 (USB_VDD)    C9: at pin 43 (ADC_AVDD)    C10: bulk, anywhere on 3V3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 26.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6ce87bbd-c9e5-4354-8fe3-cf37968980e9")
	)
	(text "1V1 core, from the internal regulator:\nC11: at pin 45 (VREG_VOUT)\nC12, C13: at DVDD pins 23 and 50"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 162.56 26.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "83eb8d90-dec9-45d4-959f-2fb11210eb4e")
	)
	(text "USB 2.0 device. R1/R2 (5.1k to GND) tell a USB-C host to supply 5 V.\nR7/R8: place close to U1 pins 46/47. Route D+/D- as a 90 ohm diff pair.\nNo ESD protection or VBUS fuse yet - add before a production spin."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 128.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bd76f552-785b-4812-97bd-f0e341a508e8")
	)
	(text "12 MHz crystal, e.g. ABM8-272-T3 (CL = 10 pF). C15/C16 = 2 x (CL - ~3 pF stray).\nRecalculate C15/C16 if you pick a different crystal. R5 limits drive level."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 138.43 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ceb2108e-0711-4255-948a-dc1db4c6de07")
	)
	(text "QSPI flash. The RP2040 has no internal flash, it boots from U2.\nHold SW1 (BOOTSEL) while applying power to enter the USB bootloader. R3 is optional."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 99.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f5844b50-45b5-415a-b4c4-c21842957070")
	)
