	(text "Analog supply: TPS7A2033 (7 uVrms) fed straight from VBUS, so AVDD never touches the digital +3.3V rail.\nLayout: C26 right at U4 pin 12 (AVDD), C25 right at pin 13 (DVDD). Keep U5 and its caps next to the ADC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "db57d3e1-c173-4a40-b276-624d3c9639b9")
	)
	(text "SPI0, mode 1 (CPOL=0, CPHA=1): GPIO2 SCLK, GPIO3 MOSI, GPIO4 MISO, GPIO5 CS, GPIO6 DRDY (falling edge = data ready).\nCLK tied to GND = internal oscillator. REFP0/REFN0 unused (internal 2.048 V reference); they may float per the datasheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "677edf26-0533-4cd4-9b6d-5b76b4205aa0")
	)
	(text "Input filter per pair: 1k in each leg, 100nF across the pair, 10nF from each leg to GND (differential fc ~760 Hz, common-mode fc ~16 kHz).\nDifferential: sensor on pin 1 (+) and pin 2 (-), PGA gain up to 128. Single-ended: sensor from AINx to the GND terminal, PGA bypassed, gain 1-4.\nA floating source (bare thermocouple) needs a DC path: bias its - leg, e.g. link pin 2 to GND and bypass the PGA, or add bias resistors."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 261.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3831bc65-66f1-4193-9c5e-a155af74823a")
	)
